== S5  closed 2-chains ((H1)-refined class): slab doubling ==
  polyomino P of area n  ->  closed surface d(P x [0,1]) of area 2n + perim(P) <= 4n + 2
  distinct P give distinct surfaces => N_cyc(<= 4n+2) >= A_n
  => mu_cyc >= lim A_n^(1/(4n+2)) = mu_poly^(1/4)
    mu_poly=3.04123 (n=13 lb)  =>  mu_cyc >= 1.32057  (gamma_cyc >= 0.27807)  < e
    mu_poly=3.08909 (n=14 lb)  =>  mu_cyc >= 1.32574  (gamma_cyc >= 0.28197)  < e
    mu_poly=4.06260 (lit)  =>  mu_cyc >= 1.41971  (gamma_cyc >= 0.35046)  < e
  tube family gives mu_cyc <= 1.6818 too => the closed class is NOT excluded by these bounds

